OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FLive music from kora player Sura
OL,7,     FSusso and guitarist Habib Koite.
OL,8,     FSoprano Adriana Gonzalez on
OL,9,     Fstarring in Carmen.
OL,10,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,11,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Fsoundscape of classical music
OL,13,     Fincluding relaxing works by
OL,14,     FMozart, Rachel Portman and Jules
OL,15,     FMassenet.
OL,16,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     FThe celebrated Argentine pianist
OL,18,     FNelson Goerner plays a programme
OL,19,     Fthat includes JS Bach's Toccata in
OL,20,     FC minor, Schumann's Fantasie in C,
OL,21,     Fand Schubert's Piano Sonata in C
OL,22,     Fminor.
