OL,5,G2145 The Essay: John Foxx - Key Moments
OL,6,     FJohn Foxx takes us through the
OL,7,     Fhistory of the five pianos which
OL,8,     Fhave shaped his music. As the lead
OL,9,     Fsinger of Ultravox and a solo
OL,10,     Fartist, pianos have been his
OL,11,     Flife-long obsession.
OL,12,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,13,     FHannah Peel presents an
OL,14,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Feverything in between.
